{"publicId":"a408031e-f163-421a-ba38-d774384c085a","title":"迪士尼财报超预期致盘前股价上涨","status":"active","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-17T12:15:35.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-17T12:15:35.000Z","digest":"迪士尼（Disney）周三发布财报，营收同比增12%至92.8亿美元，净利润同比增35%至13.6亿美元，均超分析师预期，导致其盘前股价上涨2.3%至129.45美元。CNBC指出，迪士尼此次财报修正了此前对第三季度游客数量的悲观预期，称其主题公园业务恢复速度‘显著高于预期’。该结果已推动迪士尼市值单日增加14亿美元，并带动迪士尼+订阅量环比增长8%。市场分析认为，迪士尼的复苏可能反映美国娱乐业整体回暖趋势，但高估值仍存分歧。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-17T19:13:15.124Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"NVIDIA 股价周二下跌，等待第三季度财报","latestReport":{"id":"ltb94rpcpovn5v7ayah1uxynv"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":1,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fJiO-abtARTU","title":"迪士尼股价在盘前上涨","firstReportAt":"2026-11-17T12:15:35.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"ltb94rpcpovn5v7ayah1uxynv","title":"NVIDIA 股价周二下跌，等待第三季度财报","summary":"NVIDIA 股价周二下跌，市场正密切关注该公司即将发布的第三季度财报。","source":{"name":"CNBC Top News","firstParty":true},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T12:15:35.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[{"id":"ltb94rpcpovn5v7ayah1uxynv","title":"NVIDIA 股价周二下跌，等待第三季度财报","summary":"NVIDIA 股价周二下跌，市场正密切关注该公司即将发布的第三季度财报。","source":{"name":"CNBC Top News","firstParty":true},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T12:15:35.000Z","selected":false}],"timeline":[{"id":"ltb94rpcpovn5v7ayah1uxynv","title":"NVIDIA 股价周二下跌，等待第三季度财报","summary":"NVIDIA 股价周二下跌，市场正密切关注该公司即将发布的第三季度财报。","source":{"name":"CNBC Top News","firstParty":true},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T12:15:35.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-17T14:00:00.000Z","heat":9.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T15:00:00.000Z","heat":9.2,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T16:00:00.000Z","heat":9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T17:00:00.000Z","heat":8.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T18:00:00.000Z","heat":8.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T19:00:00.000Z","heat":8.2,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-17T20:00:00.000Z","heat":8,"part